>gnusto scroll
Your spell book begins to glow softly. Slowly, ornately, the words of the lobal spell are inscribed, glowing even more brightly then the book itself. The book's brightness fades, but the spell remains! However, the scroll on which it was written vanishes as the last word is copied.

>examine door
It just looks like an ordinary heavy iron door.

>north

Gorse Bushes
The footpath from the cave mouth runs into dense, impenetrable gorse bushes. Perhaps it wasn't so much a footpath as a rill in the earth where roots wouldn't take; anyway, there's no way but back south.

Slung over one of the gorse bushes is a beautiful red carpet.

>examine carpet
This is a carpet of unusual design. It is red, beautifully woven and bears a pattern of cubes.

>take carpet
Taken.

